<title>USA: Lawson Products authorizes share buyback.</title>
<headline>Lawson Products authorizes share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lawson Products Inc said Wednesday its board authorized the purchase of up to one million shares of its common stock from time to time in open market or privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>At June 30, the company, a distributor of repair and replacement parts and supplies, had 11.6 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
